WEBVTT

01:38.920 --> 01:41.160
The Yu's brocade has been known
for their quaint patterns.

01:41.760 --> 01:45.120
Mr. Yu's son once tried to recreate
this ancient pattern from Gubei Village,

01:45.920 --> 01:48.320
but he tragically lost
his life there by accident.

01:49.000 --> 01:52.520
Over the years, Mr. Yu has longed
to fulfill his son's wish,

01:52.600 --> 01:54.000
but he has never succeeded.

01:54.920 --> 01:56.640
This has always been his deepest regret

01:56.720 --> 01:58.920
and one of the reasons
he refused to sell the brocade workshop,

01:59.000 --> 02:00.800
despite having no interest in running it.

02:01.560 --> 02:04.200
So, if we retrieve
the pattern from Gubei Village,

02:04.280 --> 02:05.680
we might be able to persuade Mr. Yu?

02:06.880 --> 02:08.000
I hope so.

02:15.080 --> 02:17.840
Yingying, this is my first time
to be so far from home.

02:17.920 --> 02:19.480
Now, this feels like a proper runaway!

02:20.000 --> 02:22.480
Please don't say that.
If your father and mother hear this,

02:22.560 --> 02:24.200
they will blame me again.

02:29.680 --> 02:32.160
GUBEI VILLAGE

02:38.840 --> 02:40.120
There are sheep over there!

02:41.720 --> 02:43.440
If you catch me,
I will give you this flag.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.760
Stop right there. Give me the flag!

02:44.840 --> 02:45.840
Give me the flag…

02:45.920 --> 02:46.960
Yingying, look!

02:47.040 --> 02:49.760
The pattern on that flag
matches the one in the drawing.

02:50.800 --> 02:52.080
It was drawn on the flag.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.280
While the shapes are identical,

02:53.360 --> 02:55.880
they lack the depth,
texture, and intricate details

02:55.960 --> 02:56.960
present in the drawing.

02:57.560 --> 03:00.120
They must have created
a rough sketch based on an old brocade.

03:00.920 --> 03:02.400
I must have made a mistake.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.440
Why don't you take a closer look?

03:04.520 --> 03:06.280
Maybe you will spot something else.

03:07.120 --> 03:09.000
I'm certain they will
be more likely to show it

03:09.080 --> 03:10.800
to a gracious and kind lady like you.

03:11.600 --> 03:14.040
Very well, I shall go ahead.
I will join you shortly.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.800
- Pin!
- Let her go.

03:17.320 --> 03:18.480
She needs to see it in person

03:18.560 --> 03:20.080
and learns that there
are other paths in this world.

03:20.160 --> 03:22.440
It is up to her which path
she wants to take.

03:24.080 --> 03:24.920
Wang, the ritual is about to start.

03:25.000 --> 03:27.400
- Hurry up…!
- Let's go!

03:27.480 --> 03:28.640
Ritual?

03:28.720 --> 03:30.000
They are holding a ritual today.

03:30.080 --> 03:31.320
Let's go take a look, too!

03:42.240 --> 03:43.480
Outsiders, please stop here.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.640
Pardon us.

03:45.720 --> 03:48.440
Abundant millet and ripened grain.

03:48.960 --> 03:52.040
Granaries brimming with their gain.

03:52.120 --> 03:55.120
Boundless harvests beyond compare.

03:55.200 --> 03:58.480
From them, wine and sweet ale are made.

03:59.400 --> 04:02.520
I never imagined we'd cross paths
four times in just a few days.

04:02.600 --> 04:04.920
It seems kismet brought us together.

04:06.440 --> 04:08.040
Mr. Bai, I knew you would be here.

04:08.800 --> 04:11.400
I'm here the same reason as you are.

04:12.080 --> 04:15.680
Mr. Bai, it seems you truly desire
the Yu's brocade workshop.

04:16.880 --> 04:18.680
Did it feel like I wasn't serious before?

04:20.040 --> 04:22.240
Looks like we will be facing off
against each other today.

04:22.320 --> 04:23.840
The ceremony is complete.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.160
Chief,

04:26.920 --> 04:29.280
could you please make an exception

04:29.360 --> 04:31.200
and help me out this once?

04:31.880 --> 04:35.040
There is nothing else
I ask for in the rest of my life.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.240
The only thing I care about

04:38.440 --> 04:39.640
is this brocade design.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.640
It was my son's obsession,

04:42.720 --> 04:44.840
and it has become mine as well.

04:44.920 --> 04:46.960
I beg you. Please let me see it once more

04:47.880 --> 04:49.440
before my life ends.

04:49.520 --> 04:51.280
You understand the situation.

04:51.360 --> 04:53.560
After what happened to your son,

04:53.640 --> 04:57.480
we have banned outsiders

04:57.560 --> 04:59.560
from coming near the artifact.
It aims to stop others

05:00.160 --> 05:03.600
from being drawn in
and meeting the same fate.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.040
I didn't expect

05:16.720 --> 05:18.840
Mr. Yu to be so fixated.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.600
Mr. Bai, do you not have
your own obsessions?

05:20.680 --> 05:23.040
Yes, I do. My obsession is Shu brocade.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.800
What? You don't believe me?

05:25.680 --> 05:27.720
Yes, I believe you. Why wouldn't I?

05:29.520 --> 05:31.640
Ms. Ji, what about you?
Do you have an obsession?

05:31.720 --> 05:32.960
It's about brocade as well.

05:56.320 --> 05:57.200
Distract him for me.

05:59.840 --> 06:01.840
Mr. Bai, I'm one of Yingying's friends.

06:01.920 --> 06:04.760
I'm the owner of Yuebuhuan Inn in Yizhou.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

06:04.840 --> 06:05.880
The pleasure is mine.

06:06.960 --> 06:07.840
Mr. Yu!

06:10.880 --> 06:12.760
- Ms. Ji!
- Mr. Yu.

06:14.160 --> 06:17.680
Ms. Ji,
Xi must have told you that I was here.

06:19.120 --> 06:21.600
Ms. Ji, did you come here
for the brocade workshop?

06:22.600 --> 06:23.440
Yes.

06:24.240 --> 06:26.520
I'm also here to honor
a century-old heritage

06:26.600 --> 06:27.760
and follow my passion for brocade.

06:28.680 --> 06:30.160
You should understand

06:30.240 --> 06:33.360
that our Ji family
has its own obsessions as well.

06:33.440 --> 06:36.600
That is why I empathize with you
and want to help you.

06:37.640 --> 06:39.560
You are willing to brave any risk

06:39.640 --> 06:42.440
just to bring Shu Red back.

06:43.040 --> 06:46.200
I really admire you, Ms. Ji.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.040
It's just that

06:50.720 --> 06:52.880
the Yu family has no heir like you.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.360
Mr. Yu…

06:57.520 --> 06:58.480
Yingying.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.960
Why are you here? Where is Bai Sheng?

07:02.560 --> 07:04.240
He left after exchanging
a few pleasantries,

07:04.320 --> 07:06.360
saying he wanted to have
a look around the village.

07:06.440 --> 07:07.800
What a pity.

07:07.880 --> 07:09.320
I was thinking of challenging him.

07:09.400 --> 07:10.520
He knows martial arts?

07:11.520 --> 07:13.320
He has strong lower body
and steady breathing.

07:13.400 --> 07:15.360
He is a formidable martial arts expert.

08:30.840 --> 08:32.159
Who are you? How did you get in here?

08:32.240 --> 08:33.640
How dare you trespass
in our ancestral hall?

08:37.400 --> 08:38.520
The brocade design has been stolen!

08:40.440 --> 08:41.559
- Don't let him get away!
- Get him!

08:41.640 --> 08:42.919
What?

08:43.000 --> 08:44.240
The brocade design has been stolen?

08:45.920 --> 08:46.960
Don't let him get away!

08:47.680 --> 08:49.840
- Hurry…!
- Catch him!

08:50.720 --> 08:52.960
Chief, what is going on?

08:53.040 --> 08:54.240
What happened?

08:54.320 --> 08:55.560
Mr. Yu,

08:55.640 --> 08:59.280
our village has been nothing
but welcoming, especially toward you.

08:59.360 --> 09:02.880
And yet you've brought these outsiders
to steal our sacred artifacts.

09:02.960 --> 09:05.400
- Is this the way you treat your host?
- What did you say?

09:05.920 --> 09:07.280
The brocade design was lost?

09:11.520 --> 09:13.960
You must have worked together
to steal our brocade!

09:14.040 --> 09:15.560
Exactly! Hand over the brocade design

09:15.640 --> 09:16.840
and spare yourself the interrogation.

09:16.920 --> 09:18.640
Speak up! Where did you hide it?

09:18.720 --> 09:22.360
- Hand it over!
- Hand over the brocade design!

09:22.440 --> 09:24.600
Hand it over! Where did you hide it?

09:24.680 --> 09:26.920
- Hand it over now! Speak!
- Tell us!

09:27.000 --> 09:28.160
Ms. Ji!

09:29.320 --> 09:31.040
Help, Ms. Ji!

09:32.240 --> 09:33.200
Outsiders?

09:33.280 --> 09:34.280
They are outsiders too.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.440
Don't try to run!

09:39.000 --> 09:42.880
You outsiders must be on board with this.

09:42.960 --> 09:46.280
If the brocade design is not on him,
it must be with you.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.320
I…

09:48.000 --> 09:50.280
Before this, none of us
had even crossed the threshold.

09:50.360 --> 09:52.160
If you don't believe us, go and ask him.

09:52.240 --> 09:53.080
He can vouch for us.

09:53.160 --> 09:55.320
When they attempted to enter earlier,
I halted them at the gate.

09:55.400 --> 09:57.760
I saw them head into the village instead.

09:58.400 --> 10:00.640
Then, why are you outsiders
in our village in the first place?

10:00.720 --> 10:01.720
You must be up to something.

10:01.800 --> 10:03.760
If you don't trust us, search us then.

10:03.840 --> 10:06.560
We can come with you
to send that man to the bureau.

10:06.640 --> 10:08.560
The officials will investigate

10:08.640 --> 10:10.320
and confirm that we barely know him.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.600
Ms. Ji,

10:12.680 --> 10:13.760
it is one thing
that you turn a blind eye to my dilemma,

10:13.840 --> 10:15.720
but must you fan the flames?

10:17.080 --> 10:20.880
Mr. Yu, don't you wish to know
where the brocade pattern is?

10:20.960 --> 10:22.640
You may not know this,

10:22.720 --> 10:24.560
but Ms. Ji is exceptionally clever.

10:24.640 --> 10:27.480
I believe she can help you
recover the brocade pattern.

10:29.240 --> 10:30.160
Ms. Ji,

10:31.440 --> 10:35.280
if you truly have a solution,
please share it.

10:35.360 --> 10:38.360
I want for nothing more
for the rest of my life.

10:38.440 --> 10:41.400
All that is left for me
is that brocade design.

10:42.000 --> 10:44.160
If you can truly help me see it once more,

10:44.240 --> 10:47.400
I will gladly give you
the brocade workshop.

10:49.160 --> 10:50.240
Ms. Ji,

10:50.920 --> 10:52.120
please, I beg you.

10:53.880 --> 10:55.360
Yingying, please reconsider.

10:55.440 --> 10:57.240
Once you speak up,
you will be involved in this mess.

10:57.760 --> 10:59.880
With so many people here,
I can't protect all of you.

11:05.920 --> 11:07.360
The brocade pattern wasn't stolen by him.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.240
He was caught red-handed.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.200
Are you implying that he did not steal it?

11:11.280 --> 11:14.280
With his cunning and skills,
if he had truly stolen it,

11:14.360 --> 11:15.480
you would never
have been able to catch him.

11:16.320 --> 11:18.120
The only reason he surrendered

11:18.200 --> 11:21.360
and dragged others down with him
while he sat back and watched

11:21.440 --> 11:22.440
is because he did not steal the brocade.

11:24.360 --> 11:26.360
I am astonished at how well Ms. Ji

11:26.440 --> 11:29.120
has come to understand me
in just a few days.

11:30.000 --> 11:32.120
Madam, if you wish to save him,

11:32.200 --> 11:33.280
you must show us the evidence.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.040
I don't have any,

11:35.560 --> 11:37.800
but I can help you find the real thief

11:38.760 --> 11:40.000
and recover the brocade pattern.

11:40.960 --> 11:41.840
Are you sure about this?

11:41.920 --> 11:43.760
- Why not give it a try?
- But if you fail,

11:44.800 --> 11:46.560
all of you will be buried in the ground

11:46.640 --> 11:48.360
to atone to the God of Grain.

11:48.440 --> 11:50.000
- Yes.
- That is how it should be!

11:50.080 --> 11:51.280
So be it.

11:54.160 --> 11:55.000
Alright.

11:55.640 --> 11:56.640
But I have one condition.

11:57.800 --> 12:01.120
Chief, please allow me
into the ancestral hall to pray.

12:01.200 --> 12:04.160
I would like to pray to the God of Grain
for guidance in finding the real thief.

12:04.240 --> 12:07.040
Outsiders aren't allowed
to enter our ancestral hall.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.320
‪Outsiders can't do this.

12:08.920 --> 12:11.960
You don't trust us,
but surely you trust your God of Grain?

12:16.320 --> 12:22.520
CONCEALING BLESSINGS AND HARBORING PEACE

12:25.520 --> 12:28.880
Everyone, I have received guidance
from the God of Grain.

12:29.400 --> 12:32.000
We will definitely catch
the true thief today.

12:32.960 --> 12:34.240
Chief,

12:34.320 --> 12:38.080
I need a bowl of clean water
and some plant ash.

12:39.880 --> 12:41.560
You two, get everything prepared.

12:44.360 --> 12:47.160
I observed your brocade from far earlier.

12:47.240 --> 12:49.440
It had a base color mixed with green.

12:49.520 --> 12:52.000
In the past, there was only
one way to dye fabric green,

12:52.080 --> 12:53.120
which was to use minerals.

12:53.800 --> 12:56.200
There is a special substance
in these minerals

12:56.280 --> 12:58.720
that will turn red when it
comes into contact with water

12:58.800 --> 12:59.920
mixed with plant ash

13:00.000 --> 13:02.920
and remains so
for ten days without fading.

13:12.560 --> 13:13.520
Everyone, take a look!

13:13.600 --> 13:15.560
My hands remain unstained

13:15.640 --> 13:18.320
because I never touched the brocade.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.840
Chief, please lend me your hands.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.680
See? His hands turned red.

13:28.760 --> 13:32.320
Chief touched the brocade before,
which is why his hand reacted.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.200
Mr. Bai here…

13:34.280 --> 13:35.200
Alright.

13:35.280 --> 13:37.280
Let me give it a try too.

13:39.760 --> 13:42.720
Everyone, everyone, stay calm.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.800
I'm not running away. Come on.

13:55.680 --> 13:56.720
It doesn't seem to be him.

13:56.800 --> 13:59.080
So, we have proven our innocence.

13:59.880 --> 14:02.840
Next, we will need to test
each and every villager.

14:04.400 --> 14:06.720
Line up, everyone.
We will test you one by one.

14:09.720 --> 14:12.120
Why does the water turn red like that?

14:12.200 --> 14:14.160
Even if the mineral has this property,

14:14.240 --> 14:16.840
how could it still work
after a hundred years?

14:17.760 --> 14:19.720
I do not have to explain myself
to a thief.

14:21.040 --> 14:24.000
I am just curious.
I wanted to look at that brocade.

14:24.080 --> 14:25.720
Who knew that this would happen?

14:25.800 --> 14:26.680
I am innocent too.

14:27.520 --> 14:29.160
You could have escaped.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.080
Why did you get us involved in this?

14:31.160 --> 14:34.240
If I escaped,
that would make me seem guilty.

14:34.760 --> 14:36.440
Besides, if I had truly fled,

14:36.520 --> 14:39.040
wouldn't the real thief
have escaped as well?

14:40.560 --> 14:41.440
Ms. Ji,

14:42.040 --> 14:44.480
what is so special about the water?

14:44.560 --> 14:46.080
I hope you will share it with me.

14:54.920 --> 14:56.560
Dear God of Grain,

14:56.640 --> 14:59.840
I am a descendant of the Ji family
from Huanhua Dyehouse, Ji Yingying.

14:59.920 --> 15:04.040
I came to Gubei Village
to have a look at the brocade pattern.

15:04.120 --> 15:06.560
I have no intentions
of being disrespectful.

15:08.320 --> 15:11.320
God of Grain, you are a generous God.

15:11.400 --> 15:13.280
Please forgive me.

15:17.520 --> 15:18.760
Yes.

15:28.560 --> 15:31.360
The God of Grain told you the method?

15:32.480 --> 15:35.200
- No.
- Why did you say yes, then?

15:35.920 --> 15:38.680
But He told me
that if you cooperate with me,

15:38.760 --> 15:40.480
this matter can be resolved.

15:41.080 --> 15:42.000
Ms. Ji,

15:42.520 --> 15:45.640
you must not lie before the God of Grain.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.320
Why would I?

15:47.840 --> 15:49.560
He knows that I am helping Him too.

15:51.040 --> 15:53.200
There are no other choices now.

15:53.280 --> 15:54.560
Why not give it a try?

15:55.240 --> 15:58.160
If it can be found,
nothing will happen to us.

15:58.880 --> 16:01.960
If we cannot find it,
you can bury me for it.

16:04.800 --> 16:06.040
Okay.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.680
Please give me your hand.

16:14.760 --> 16:17.000
Rub this powder evenly.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.840
There is no trick.

16:21.920 --> 16:23.800
The Chief simply went along with it.

16:25.360 --> 16:26.520
I understand now.

16:27.040 --> 16:29.720
You are wagering on human nature.

16:30.240 --> 16:32.760
But what if it was not
the villagers who did it?

16:33.560 --> 16:35.160
To act faster than Mr. Bai

16:35.240 --> 16:37.640
and immediately turn around
to accuse someone of theft,

16:37.720 --> 16:40.000
I can think of no one else
but the villagers.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.680
That is logical.

16:44.280 --> 16:46.400
Liu Er! Where are you going?

16:49.440 --> 16:50.760
I did not steal the brocade design.

16:50.840 --> 16:52.200
Why should I be tested?

16:52.280 --> 16:53.440
I have things to do at home!

16:53.520 --> 16:54.760
Bring him back!

16:54.840 --> 16:56.120
Why should you skip it?

16:56.200 --> 16:57.600
- I did not steal the brocade design.
- I suppose we found it.

16:57.680 --> 16:59.640
I did not steal it!
Why should I be tested?

16:59.720 --> 17:00.880
- I…
- You have to be tested!

17:00.960 --> 17:01.840
Liu Er,

17:01.920 --> 17:02.960
did you steal the brocade design?

17:03.040 --> 17:04.200
I did not!

17:04.280 --> 17:05.920
Why are you afraid
of the test if you did not?

17:06.440 --> 17:07.720
Test! You must be tested!

17:07.800 --> 17:09.359
- Test! You have no choice but to do it!
- Test!

17:09.440 --> 17:10.680
You must be tested!

17:10.760 --> 17:12.119
- Give me your hand!
- Hand!

17:12.200 --> 17:13.960
- Give him your hand!
- Give it!

17:14.040 --> 17:15.880
- Test! You must be tested!
- Test!

17:15.960 --> 17:16.839
Hand!

17:20.000 --> 17:22.599
God of Grain! Forgive me!

17:23.560 --> 17:25.079
God of Grain, please forgive me!

17:25.160 --> 17:26.680
I was forced to do this!

17:27.359 --> 17:30.800
Liu Er, what have gotten into you?

17:30.880 --> 17:32.720
How dare you steal the brocade design!

17:32.800 --> 17:34.760
Are you tired of living?

17:34.840 --> 17:37.360
Do you want to be buried alive?

17:37.440 --> 17:38.640
Chief,

17:39.280 --> 17:41.080
I was forced to do that!

17:41.600 --> 17:42.960
Surely you must know…

17:43.480 --> 17:44.680
My son fell sick recently.

17:45.640 --> 17:47.800
I truly don't have the money
for his medical bills at the moment.

17:47.880 --> 17:50.040
If the God of Grain
is truly protecting me,

17:50.120 --> 17:51.360
He will not blame me

17:51.440 --> 17:53.240
for stealing it and then selling it off
to get money for my son's illness!

17:53.320 --> 17:55.000
You sold the brocade design?

17:55.600 --> 17:57.160
- Beat him!
- Hit him!

17:57.240 --> 17:59.200
Kill him!

18:04.000 --> 18:05.240
I was not able to sell it.

18:05.840 --> 18:08.440
I was too nervous when stealing it.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.880
I did not control my strength.

18:11.600 --> 18:12.920
It is in ruins now.

18:13.920 --> 18:15.000
Liu Er!

18:15.080 --> 18:17.000
You have a death wish!

18:17.840 --> 18:19.880
You have wronged the whole village!

18:19.960 --> 18:21.520
I admit!

18:21.600 --> 18:23.400
I deserve to die!

18:24.680 --> 18:26.560
But I want to say

18:27.280 --> 18:29.080
that we are all too poor!

18:30.120 --> 18:31.480
Instead of guarding it,

18:32.000 --> 18:34.840
why not sell it off
to get us all some money?

18:35.800 --> 18:37.760
Not just my family!

18:38.640 --> 18:40.120
There are Mrs. Zhang's Chunfen

18:40.920 --> 18:42.640
and Liu Wu's Xiao Mutou.

18:43.160 --> 18:46.320
Which of them did not die
or become crippled

18:46.840 --> 18:48.400
because they lacked the money
to see a physician?

18:49.640 --> 18:51.480
Even your family, Chief!

18:55.480 --> 18:56.760
This brocade design

18:58.480 --> 19:00.840
was bestowed upon our ancestors
after they planted the grains,

19:01.360 --> 19:02.960
when they were poor

19:03.720 --> 19:07.000
but protected by the God of Grain!

19:07.080 --> 19:09.960
He was able to save our ancestors.

19:11.360 --> 19:14.040
If He is truly capable
of protecting us now,

19:14.560 --> 19:17.920
He should save us as well!

19:28.040 --> 19:29.160
I guess…

19:32.160 --> 19:34.960
I guess I really
should not be so stubborn.

19:46.520 --> 19:48.560
Everyone, I have a plan.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.800
This brocade is already broken.

19:52.320 --> 19:54.720
Why don't you give this to Mr. Yu?

19:54.800 --> 19:58.960
He can return this old brocade
once he has created a new brocade.

19:59.040 --> 20:01.840
We will give this village some money

20:01.920 --> 20:04.000
for every piece of brocade sold,

20:04.080 --> 20:05.640
so that you can all live a good life.

20:06.760 --> 20:10.560
If anyone in the village wishes
to learn how to weave brocade

20:10.640 --> 20:12.680
or seeks to make a living from it,

20:12.760 --> 20:14.080
I am willing to lend a hand.

20:14.160 --> 20:16.000
Can this be repaired?

20:16.960 --> 20:18.120
No.

20:18.200 --> 20:20.360
While you did not steal it,

20:20.440 --> 20:22.960
it was ruined when you arrived.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.760
That means the God of Grain
does not welcome you.

20:25.840 --> 20:27.960
No, you have got it wrong.

20:28.040 --> 20:31.360
We came here
just after your brocade broke.

20:32.840 --> 20:35.200
Mr. Yu comes from
a brocade weaving family.

20:36.040 --> 20:38.680
I specialize in dyeing
and selecting colors for silk.

20:39.200 --> 20:42.920
Ms. Zhu is the best at embroidering
from Yizhou.

20:43.440 --> 20:45.640
I suppose your God

20:45.720 --> 20:48.360
brought us here
to help you repair this brocade

20:48.440 --> 20:49.640
and begin anew.

20:52.640 --> 20:54.080
You…

20:54.160 --> 20:55.560
You can really repair the brocade?

20:58.040 --> 21:00.520
Mr. Yu, are you willing to assist?

21:05.480 --> 21:07.720
Shu brocade has been revered
since the Wei and Jin dynasties.

21:08.480 --> 21:10.640
It has endured much through the ages,

21:11.160 --> 21:12.880
but as long as there is a glimmer of hope,

21:12.960 --> 21:15.600
we Shu Jin family will not give up easily.

21:16.200 --> 21:18.240
That is why Shu brocade has been
passed down through the generations

21:18.320 --> 21:19.600
and survived all crises.

21:22.880 --> 21:24.160
Instead of guarding yourself
from outsiders forever,

21:24.240 --> 21:25.760
why not stand up today

21:26.520 --> 21:28.560
so that others cannot easily hurt you?

21:29.160 --> 21:30.680
If the Yu family becomes stronger,

21:30.760 --> 21:33.040
the Yu family's descendants
will be blessed too.

21:40.160 --> 21:41.440
Grandfather,

21:42.200 --> 21:44.200
this is Father's favorite brocade.

21:47.080 --> 21:47.920
Okay.

21:49.480 --> 21:50.520
Okay!

22:00.520 --> 22:03.280
GUBEI VILLAGE

22:05.920 --> 22:06.760
Ms. Ji,

22:10.520 --> 22:11.520
the silk you requested.

22:12.040 --> 22:13.040
Thank you!

23:03.320 --> 23:05.360
Commissioner! You have great skills!

23:09.560 --> 23:11.160
Come on! It's your turn now!

23:12.440 --> 23:13.720
Commissioner…

23:13.800 --> 23:14.840
It is fine.

23:15.800 --> 23:18.120
Mr. Yang is skilled at fighting.

23:18.640 --> 23:21.560
I am sure he will not harm me.

23:32.680 --> 23:34.280
Since you trust me,

23:35.160 --> 23:38.280
why not raise the stakes?

23:48.800 --> 23:50.760
Yang Jinglan! What are you trying to do?

23:53.200 --> 23:54.320
Commissioner,

23:54.400 --> 23:56.560
I am willing to accept
the arrow on your behalf.

24:15.800 --> 24:16.960
Wait.

24:20.360 --> 24:21.240
I…

24:21.320 --> 24:25.040
did not agree
to shoot the apple on his head.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.240
Protect the commissioner!

24:39.800 --> 24:44.240
You were certain
that I would protect the book?

24:44.320 --> 24:46.680
I heard that you are a lover
of historical manuscripts.

24:46.760 --> 24:48.000
You love books as much as your life.

24:48.080 --> 24:51.040
Why would you allow me
to ruin your historical manuscript?

24:53.560 --> 24:56.320
If… I did not block it in time?

24:57.320 --> 25:00.400
This arrow would land close to it.

25:02.520 --> 25:03.880
Brave and smart.

25:04.400 --> 25:06.480
Very good. Get him some tea!

25:10.760 --> 25:11.600
Thanks, Commissioner!

25:20.240 --> 25:22.000
Smuggling tribute brocade.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.800
Faming the Brocade Master.

25:26.120 --> 25:27.680
Murdering brocade officers.

25:29.200 --> 25:31.640
Is Niu Jin that free?

25:33.200 --> 25:34.080
Commissioner,

25:34.600 --> 25:36.720
General Niu has been
your friend for years.

25:37.320 --> 25:39.640
I do not dare hope
that a few words from me

25:39.720 --> 25:41.560
can earn your trust.

25:42.760 --> 25:45.960
I only ask that you will give me
the opportunity to investigate this.

25:46.040 --> 25:47.480
If it is proven,

25:47.560 --> 25:49.240
I am willing
to eradicate the evil for you.

25:49.320 --> 25:50.600
What if it is not?

25:51.760 --> 25:52.760
If it is not proven,

25:53.800 --> 25:55.480
General Niu is innocent.

25:55.560 --> 25:57.720
Your relationship with him
will be even stronger.

25:59.760 --> 26:01.120
After so much investigations,

26:02.000 --> 26:05.200
I worry that the false accusations
would also become the truth.

26:07.040 --> 26:08.720
I have heard that the reason you have come

26:09.600 --> 26:12.680
is to clean up
the brocade businesses in Yizhou.

26:14.560 --> 26:16.680
Yizhou is your territory.

26:16.760 --> 26:19.440
The brocade business is your business.

26:20.040 --> 26:22.480
I am here only to investigate

26:22.560 --> 26:25.160
who caused the death of my master.

26:27.320 --> 26:28.400
Your master?

26:30.040 --> 26:32.120
The previous brocade officer, Shen Rufeng.

26:33.880 --> 26:36.080
An unknown officer

26:36.600 --> 26:39.120
is able to mentor a student like you?

26:40.440 --> 26:41.400
Yes.

26:41.920 --> 26:45.320
Shen Rufeng is indeed an unknown officer,

26:45.400 --> 26:49.000
but I wonder if you
have heard of Shen Qingping?

26:50.040 --> 26:51.080
Shen Qingping?

26:52.640 --> 26:55.600
That man who fought against ten men alone…

26:55.680 --> 26:57.400
The one who defeated
the envoys from ten countries?

26:57.480 --> 26:58.680
Yes.

27:00.760 --> 27:04.120
Commissioner, is it said that when he was
the commander of the Royal Guards,

27:04.200 --> 27:06.200
he once taught many of the princes.

27:06.280 --> 27:08.160
He is the unnamed teacher
of the crown prince.

27:11.040 --> 27:12.440
Why would someone like this

27:12.960 --> 27:16.640
be willing to hide this true identity
and become a brocade officer?

27:17.280 --> 27:20.160
Why would he die in a foreign land?

27:21.120 --> 27:23.160
That is enough to prove
the severity of this case

27:23.240 --> 27:24.720
and the depth of the conspiracy.

27:30.640 --> 27:33.800
You should know what can be investigated

27:33.880 --> 27:35.520
and what cannot.

27:36.760 --> 27:37.960
Otherwise,

27:38.480 --> 27:40.240
the reinforcements in Chang'an

27:40.320 --> 27:43.480
will not be able to help
the crisis in Yizhou.

27:45.360 --> 27:46.520
I understand.

27:47.160 --> 27:50.720
Why don't… you…
supervise my investigation?

28:09.560 --> 28:12.960
Nobody specific was appointed
to deliver the tributes,

28:13.040 --> 28:16.560
but the commander is used
to selecting men from his camp.

28:17.680 --> 28:19.120
The one who delivered
the tribute brocade ten years ago,

28:19.200 --> 28:20.560
the ones you are looking for,

28:21.080 --> 28:22.320
are those three.

28:33.720 --> 28:34.960
One!

28:35.800 --> 28:36.920
Two!

28:49.080 --> 28:50.360
I wonder

28:50.440 --> 28:52.800
who you will send to deliver
the Shu Red brocade this time.

28:53.800 --> 28:55.040
Who do you want me to send to?

29:08.840 --> 29:11.520
You have good physique
and are good at fighting.

29:12.040 --> 29:13.480
If you ever decide to resign
as a brocade officer,

29:15.320 --> 29:16.280
you can come join the army!

29:17.360 --> 29:19.600
You must be joking, General Xue.

29:19.680 --> 29:22.360
My sword is too short.
I cannot protect so many people.

29:23.280 --> 29:27.200
It is challenging enough to protect
one fearless person.

29:28.000 --> 29:28.920
However,

29:29.720 --> 29:31.880
I still have to thank you.

29:31.960 --> 29:33.080
One!

29:33.720 --> 29:34.960
Two!

29:41.320 --> 29:42.920
- The Chief is here!
- It is done!

29:44.360 --> 29:45.480
It has been repaired!

29:46.680 --> 29:47.760
Is the brocade truly repaired?

29:47.840 --> 29:49.000
It has been repaired. Look!

29:53.720 --> 29:55.880
- It is true! It has really been repaired!
- Put it down! Quick!

29:55.960 --> 29:57.840
- This is our sacred item!
- Remarkable!

29:58.440 --> 29:59.320
Put it back!

29:59.960 --> 30:01.080
Move aside!

30:02.400 --> 30:03.400
Mr. Yu!

30:04.280 --> 30:05.200
Ms. Ji,

30:05.720 --> 30:07.600
if you have time in a few days,

30:07.680 --> 30:11.720
please come to my place to discuss
the transfer of the dyehouse.

30:13.960 --> 30:15.160
Mr. Yu,

30:15.680 --> 30:17.280
I still stand by what I said.

30:17.360 --> 30:18.800
I don't want your dyehouse.

30:19.320 --> 30:20.560
I want to work with you.

30:22.560 --> 30:24.680
Shu brocade has been passed down
through the generations,

30:24.760 --> 30:27.120
but it is not because
every family had an heir.

30:27.200 --> 30:29.040
It is because the Shu brocade businesses
supported one another

30:29.120 --> 30:30.320
and ensured its survival.

30:30.400 --> 30:32.000
That is why we still have
the Shu brocade today.

30:33.000 --> 30:34.560
I wonder if the Bloom Society and I

30:34.640 --> 30:38.480
will have the honor of inheriting
the Yu family's technique.

30:40.120 --> 30:41.120
Good.

30:41.960 --> 30:46.120
Since your ambition knows no bounds,

30:46.200 --> 30:48.400
why should I fear?

30:48.480 --> 30:49.600
Very well!

30:50.120 --> 30:52.520
I shall give it my all
and make another attempt.

30:53.200 --> 30:55.400
I can see you floating!
Grandfather is floating!

30:58.960 --> 31:00.560
The renewed life of this brocade design

31:00.640 --> 31:02.840
is thanks to the aid
of each and every one of you.

31:03.520 --> 31:04.680
Let us…

31:05.200 --> 31:06.320
Ready the feast!

31:06.400 --> 31:09.080
Begin the dance to honor
the arrival of our esteemed guests!

31:09.160 --> 31:11.440
Yes!

31:11.520 --> 31:12.400
Let's go!

31:35.360 --> 31:36.360
Look at it if you wish!

31:37.720 --> 31:38.680
It is inappropriate.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.640
But you wished to look.

31:42.040 --> 31:42.880
No, I don't.

31:44.520 --> 31:47.080
Why must it be gentlemen who wishes
beautiful and virtuous ladies?

31:47.160 --> 31:49.440
Why can't a lady wish for handsome
and chivalrous gentlemen?

31:49.520 --> 31:52.840
Most of the rules for women
in society are ridiculous!

31:53.360 --> 31:54.680
But if you rebel against it,

31:54.760 --> 31:56.680
they will think
that you are the ridiculous one.

32:04.280 --> 32:05.240
Remarkable!

32:06.800 --> 32:09.440
I was able to weather this crisis
thanks to you, Ms. Ji.

32:10.640 --> 32:12.960
Someone as cunning as you
would have escaped unscathed,

32:13.040 --> 32:14.560
even without my assistance.

32:15.440 --> 32:18.480
If I could have escaped on my own,

32:18.560 --> 32:20.800
why would I have given
this opportunity to you?

32:21.720 --> 32:22.960
Indeed! Why is that so?

32:23.040 --> 32:24.640
Yeah, I wonder why.

32:27.000 --> 32:28.280
I wonder if there will be an opportunity

32:28.360 --> 32:29.760
for us to do business
together in the future.

32:29.840 --> 32:33.320
If I do have the opportunity,
I hope you will approach it with honesty.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.600
Ms. Ji, Ms. Zhu,

32:40.200 --> 32:41.680
let us dance together!

32:42.640 --> 32:43.520
Sure!

32:53.040 --> 32:56.040
CONCEALING BLESSINGS AND HARBORING PEACE

33:27.840 --> 33:30.760
Whether for the brocade workshop
or the brocade pattern,

33:30.840 --> 33:32.040
I will acquire it sooner or later.

33:33.280 --> 33:36.080
But a person both interesting and useful

33:36.160 --> 33:37.840
is a rare encounter.

34:08.480 --> 34:09.320
Halt!

34:15.080 --> 34:16.159
Why are you here?

34:17.600 --> 34:18.840
There are many wicked people in the world.

34:19.639 --> 34:22.000
I fear you may fall into their trap
and be sold away.

34:25.719 --> 34:26.960
Good day, Mr. Yang.

34:27.040 --> 34:28.280
I am Bai Sheng.

34:29.560 --> 34:31.080
Mr. Bai, where are you from?

34:31.159 --> 34:32.239
I am from Nanzhao.

34:32.320 --> 34:33.159
What is your occupation?

34:34.159 --> 34:36.040
My family's assets
are enough to support me.

34:37.199 --> 34:38.639
What are you doing in Yizhou?

34:39.520 --> 34:40.520
I was drawn by its reputation.

34:40.600 --> 34:41.920
I came here to experience its culture.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.080
Whose reputation have you heard of?

34:45.120 --> 34:47.920
Mr. Yang, are you interrogating me?

34:48.000 --> 34:49.400
As Yizhou's brocade officer,

34:49.480 --> 34:52.000
it is my duty to interrogate anything
that may affect Yizhou,

34:52.080 --> 34:53.639
including the animals that come here.

34:56.239 --> 34:57.080
Last evening,

34:57.160 --> 34:58.840
Ms. Ji and I went through
a life-or-death situation.

34:59.520 --> 35:01.520
She knows me better.

35:01.600 --> 35:02.880
Why don't you ask her?

35:04.120 --> 35:05.360
It was not as exaggerated as that!

35:06.280 --> 35:08.080
We were just fighting over business!

35:09.240 --> 35:11.080
You were just working together.

35:13.120 --> 35:14.400
It was not only business.

35:18.120 --> 35:19.800
Yu! Let's hurry!

35:19.880 --> 35:22.800
Mother will kick me out
if I am not home soon!

35:23.600 --> 35:24.640
Leave?

35:25.640 --> 35:27.520
That person has to let us pass!

35:59.560 --> 36:04.240
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

36:06.120 --> 36:07.000
We have not been home for so many days.

36:07.080 --> 36:09.440
I wonder if Mother noticed.

36:11.000 --> 36:12.080
Let me have a look first.

36:19.520 --> 36:21.000
The house is so quiet.

36:21.520 --> 36:23.200
I suppose she did not notice.

36:23.280 --> 36:27.520
There is a type of quiet
that comes before the storm.

36:30.040 --> 36:33.960
Let us sneak inside quietly
and pretend nothing happened.

36:38.200 --> 36:41.520
As long as we are not caught in the act,
everything will be fine.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.480
Stop!

36:44.040 --> 36:46.000
Mother, let me explain!

36:49.600 --> 36:50.680
Your mother.

36:54.880 --> 36:55.720
Come here!

37:01.120 --> 37:03.600
You have sulked long enough.
It is time for you to come home.

37:03.680 --> 37:04.920
Mother!

37:05.520 --> 37:06.400
I have no desire to go on blind dates.

37:07.640 --> 37:09.880
You… Are you possessed?

37:09.960 --> 37:11.800
Why do you seem like a different person?

37:12.320 --> 37:13.600
Come! Come home with me.

37:13.680 --> 37:15.000
Mother!

37:15.080 --> 37:15.960
None of the women in Sandaoyan

37:16.040 --> 37:17.520
are better at breeding silkworms
than I am.

37:17.600 --> 37:19.240
I can dye silk and embroider!

37:19.920 --> 37:22.440
Last evening, I helped a village
with their brocade design,

37:22.960 --> 37:25.280
and they thanked me, praising my skills.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.680
They even called me storekeeper!

37:26.760 --> 37:28.040
Mother,

37:28.560 --> 37:29.920
there is no need to find me a husband.

37:30.000 --> 37:32.120
I can manage the family business.

37:32.200 --> 37:34.120
I can take care of you and Father.

37:34.720 --> 37:37.800
We want you to go on dates
because we are growing older.

37:37.880 --> 37:40.600
If you can yourself a reliable husband,

37:40.680 --> 37:42.360
your father and I will have no worries.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.920
Who says I have nobody to rely on?

37:44.000 --> 37:45.160
The Bloom Society is my support.

37:46.280 --> 37:48.520
Mother, I have always listened to you.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.800
Can you trust me this once, please?

37:51.480 --> 37:54.120
Your father and I
have more experience than you!

37:54.200 --> 37:55.640
Would we lead you astray?

37:56.320 --> 37:58.520
We have worked so hard,
all for your own good!

37:58.600 --> 38:00.240
I can choose my own path!

38:00.320 --> 38:02.400
I shall never regret,
even if I should fall and be wounded!

38:02.480 --> 38:04.960
You have been possessed!
You must have been possessed!

38:05.040 --> 38:07.000
Very well! If I cannot persuade you,

38:07.080 --> 38:10.280
I will fetch your father,
so that he may rouse you!

38:29.280 --> 38:32.920
Your father and mother
selected the easy path for you.

38:33.000 --> 38:34.120
A safe path.

38:34.640 --> 38:37.720
The path you have chosen
will be fraught with hardship.

38:38.240 --> 38:39.400
Have you considered it carefully?

38:42.640 --> 38:44.520
I have never been more certain
than I am at this moment.

38:45.720 --> 38:46.760
Good!

38:46.840 --> 38:48.800
You may stay in my home
for as long as you wish.

38:50.080 --> 38:51.160
I am going home.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.800
I am my parents' daughter after all.

38:56.320 --> 38:58.440
Though they cannot understand me now,

38:58.960 --> 39:01.240
there will come a day
when I can prove myself.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.200
They will surely support me then.

39:34.800 --> 39:36.400
Mother, you are here!

39:41.280 --> 39:42.760
Pin and her mother have left?

39:42.840 --> 39:44.840
Mother, I am sorry.
Mother, let me explain.

39:44.920 --> 39:47.240
I did not stay out
the whole night on purpose.

39:47.320 --> 39:48.760
I was not alone!

39:48.840 --> 39:51.080
Yu and Pin were both with me!

39:51.160 --> 39:53.640
- Mother, I will not do this again!
- You have been working for days.

39:53.720 --> 39:54.840
Go and get some rest, quickly.

39:56.080 --> 39:58.280
Mother, are you not angry with me,
nor scolding me?

39:59.040 --> 40:00.880
I have scolded you so many times.
Has it made any difference?

40:02.480 --> 40:03.560
Mother!

40:03.640 --> 40:04.840
I knew you were the best!

40:04.920 --> 40:07.400
You are so kind and generous!

40:08.560 --> 40:12.160
Your brother has gathered
the ingredients for the dye.

40:12.240 --> 40:14.120
You must not delay
the preparations for the tribute brocade.

40:14.200 --> 40:16.480
Hurry and take a nap!
Once you wake, get to work!

40:17.160 --> 40:19.120
Stop wandering about all the time.

40:19.200 --> 40:21.160
Yes! I will go get a nap now.

40:21.240 --> 40:22.080
You are the best!

40:27.040 --> 40:28.240
Hurry up!

40:42.560 --> 40:43.600
Pin?

40:44.680 --> 40:45.840
Shisi.

40:47.280 --> 40:48.320
I…

40:49.040 --> 40:50.680
I brought some pastries
from San Hua Pavilion.

40:50.760 --> 40:52.960
I am here to apologize to you.

40:54.280 --> 40:55.160
Apologize?

40:56.080 --> 40:58.160
I said the wrong thing and made you upset.

40:58.800 --> 40:59.640
I have reflected upon it for some time,

40:59.720 --> 41:01.200
yet still, I know not
how to atone for my words.

41:01.280 --> 41:03.200
In all my years,
I have never offered an apology to anyone.

41:03.800 --> 41:04.760
How about this?

41:04.840 --> 41:06.440
I will do whatever is needed,
if only to see your anger ease.

41:07.680 --> 41:09.600
It is I who should offer the apology.

41:10.120 --> 41:13.320
I was in a bad mood,
and I took it out on you.

41:16.360 --> 41:17.440
I am fine.

41:18.480 --> 41:20.560
Is this still about the blind dates, then?

41:23.800 --> 41:26.600
In truth, I was not jesting.

41:27.840 --> 41:30.160
Once I have convinced my father,
I will go to your family…

41:31.080 --> 41:33.320
To… To propose to you.

41:40.640 --> 41:41.880
I have given it much thought.

41:44.640 --> 41:45.960
I will not rush into courting.

41:51.360 --> 41:52.360
Yingying is a woman.

41:52.440 --> 41:54.320
I am also a woman.

41:54.400 --> 41:55.920
She is capable of supporting
her family's business,

41:56.640 --> 41:57.480
and so can I.

41:59.800 --> 42:01.560
But you must not shirk
the duty of marriage for your entire life!

42:06.440 --> 42:07.320
Shisi,

42:10.120 --> 42:11.480
thank you for liking me.

42:14.280 --> 42:16.160
Even if the day comes when I must marry,

42:17.120 --> 42:21.080
I would seek a man who can share with me
the trials and triumphs of life,

42:21.600 --> 42:22.880
one who will stand beside me in battle.

